:31.323" end="00:31.843">Why </span><span begin="00:31.843" end="00:32.672">carry </span><span begin="00:32.672" end="00:33.402">on </span><span begin="00:33.402" end="00:34.432">without </span><span begin="00:34.432" end="00:35.382">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.872" end="00:39.022"><span begin="00:35.872" end="00:36.932">Every time </span><span begin="00:36.932" end="00:37.272">I </span><span begin="00:37.272" end="00:38.122">try </span><span begin="00:38.122" end="00:38.382">to </span><span begin="00:38.382" end="00:39.022">fly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.022" end="00:42.232"><span begin="00:39.022" end="00:39.482">I </span><span begin="00:39.482" end="00:40.422">fall </span><span begin="00:40.422" end="00:41.202">without </span><span begin="00:41.202" end="00:41.582">my </span><span begin="00:41.582" end="00:42.232">wings</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.562" end="00:44.702"><span begin="00:42.562" end="00:42.782">I </span><span begin="00:42.782" end="00:43.222">feel </span><span begin="00:43.222" end="00:43.752">so </span><span begin="00:43.752" end="00:44.702">small</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.042" end="00:48.382"><span begin="00:45.042" end="00:45.282">I </span><span begin="00:45.282" end="00:45.692">guess </span><span begin="00:45.692" end="00:46.212">I </span><span begin="00:46.212" end="00:46.852">need </span><span begin="00:46.852" end="00:47.292">you </span><span begin="00:47.292" end="00:48.382">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.812" end="00:53.470"><span begin="00:48.812" end="00:49.132">And </span><span begin="00:49.132" end="00:49.951">every time </span><span begin="00:49.951" end="00:50.341">I </span><span begin="00:50.341" end="00:51.060">see </span><span begin="00:51.060" end="00:51.570">you </span><span begin="00:51.570" end="00:52.010">in </span><span begin="00:52.010" end="00:52.500">my </span><span begin="00:52.500" end="00:53.470">dreams</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.470" end="00:55.300"><span begin="00:53.470" end="00:53.700">I </span><span begin="00:53.700" end="00:54.190">see </span><span begin="00:54.190" end="00:54.670">your </span><span begin="00:54.670" end="00:55.300">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.660" end="00:57.650"><span begin="00:55.660" end="00:55.910">It's </span><span begin="00:55.910" end="00:56.880">haunting </span><span begin="00:56.880" end="00:57.650">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.120" end="01:01.689"><span begin="00:58.120" end="00:58.340">I </span><span begin="00:58.340" end="00:58.750">guess </span><span begin="00:58.750" end="00:59.310">I </span><span begin="00:59.310" end="00:59.960">need </span><span begin="00:59.960" end="01:00.690">you </span><span begin="01:00.690" end="01:01.689">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.354" end="01:19.084"><span begin="01:11.354" end="01:11.584">I </span><span begin="01:11.584" end="01:12.154">make </span><span begin="01:12.154" end="01:15.684">believe </span><span begin="01:15.684" end="01:15.914">that </span><span begin="01:15.914" end="01:16.434">you </span><span begin="01:16.434" end="01:16.754">are </span><span begin="01:16.754" end="01:19.084">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.984" end="01:27.744"><span begin="01:19.984" end="01:20.214">It's </span><span begin="01:20.214" end="01:20.504">the </span><span begin="01:20.504" end="01:21.074">only </span><span begin="01:21.074" end="01:24.554">way </span><span begin="01:24.554" end="01:25.084">I </span><span begin="01:25.084" end="01:25.394">see </span><span begin="01:25.394" end="01:27.744">clear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.484" end="01:30.804"><span begin="01:28.484" end="01:28.974">What </span><span begin="01:28.974" end="01:29.564">have </span><span begin="01:29.564" end="01:29.844">I </span><span begin="01:29.844" end="01:30.804">done</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.954" end="01:36.744"><span begin="01:32.954" end="01:33.294">You </span><span beg