 </span><span begin="01:53.973" end="01:54.993">dreams</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.163" end="01:56.783"><span begin="01:55.163" end="01:55.363">I </span><span begin="01:55.363" end="01:55.713">see </span><span begin="01:55.713" end="01:56.203">your </span><span begin="01:56.203" end="01:56.783">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.133" end="01:59.163"><span begin="01:57.133" end="01:57.423">You're </span><span begin="01:57.423" end="01:58.383">haunting </span><span begin="01:58.383" end="01:59.163">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.603" end="02:03.093"><span begin="01:59.603" end="01:59.823">I </span><span begin="01:59.823" end="02:00.293">guess </span><span begin="02:00.293" end="02:00.773">I </span><span begin="02:00.773" end="02:01.493">need </span><span begin="02:01.493" end="02:01.943">you </span><span begin="02:01.943" end="02:03.093">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.993" end="02:08.733"><span begin="02:04.993" end="02:05.383">I </span><span begin="02:05.383" end="02:05.933">may </span><span begin="02:05.933" end="02:06.483">have </span><span begin="02:06.483" end="02:07.143">made </span><span begin="02:07.143" end="02:07.403">it </span><span begin="02:07.403" end="02:08.733">rain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.093" end="02:12.613"><span begin="02:10.093" end="02:10.633">Please </span><span begin="02:10.633" end="02:11.523">forgive </span><span begin="02:11.523" end="02:12.613">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.483" end="02:17.383"><span begin="02:13.483" end="02:14.103">My </span><span begin="02:14.103" end="02:15.213">weakness </span><span begin="02:15.213" end="02:15.733">caused </span><span begin="02:15.733" end="02:16.113">you </span><span begin="02:16.113" end="02:17.383">pain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.963" end="02:23.222"><span begin="02:17.963" end="02:18.253">And </span><span begin="02:18.253" end="02:18.493">this </span><span begin="02:18.493" end="02:19.013">song </span>